        "source_role": "citizen",
        "lat": 37.8962,
        "lon": 32.4845,
        "text": "The building at Lale Apartments block C has collapsed!! I can hear people shouting from inside. Please send help"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 3,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "cellular",
      "payload": {
        "id": "C-2",
        "source_id": "+90-5xx-1187",
        "source_role": "citizen",
        "text": "my mother and 2 neighbours are inside lale apartments C block 3rd floor. she is not answering her phone. please someone go there",
        "delivery_status": "delivered after 4 retries"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 4,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "facility",
      "payload": {
        "id": "F-1",
        "source_id": "aster-general-ops",
        "source_role": "facility",
        "lat": 37.8745,
        "lon": 32.5065,
        "text": "Aster General Hospital operations: our main fibre link is down and we are running on one degraded 4G router. We cannot reach the ambulance dispatch system or send imaging to other hospitals. 40 ICU patients on site and casualties are starting to arrive."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 5,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "tetra",
      "payload": {
        "id": "R-1",
        "source_id": "rescue-team-3",
        "source_role": "responder",
        "lat": 37.8961,
        "lon": 32.4848,
        "text": "Control, Team 3 on site at Lale Apartments block C. Partial collapse, we have visual on six to ten people trapped under rubble, two confirmed alive by voice contact. Our data terminal cannot connect, we need a data link to the hospital for triage coordination. Over."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 6,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "cellular",
      "payload": {
        "id": "C-3",
        "source_id": "+90-5xx-4410",
        "source_role": "citizen",
        "lat": 37.8518,
        "lon": 32.4639,
        "text": "grandfather trapped under the fallen garden wall on Ridge Lane, 2 kids with him, cant get through on 112 keeps dropping. my battery is 10%",
        "delivery_status": "delivered (SMS, weak signal)"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 7,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "citizen_app",
      "payload": {
        "id": "C-4",
        "source_id": "app-user-0912",
        "source_role": "citizen",
        "lat": 37.8605,
        "lon": 32.4902,
        "text": "Roof tiles fell onto parked cars at the harbour front promenade, nobody hurt as far as I can see"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 8,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "mesh",
      "payload": {
        "id": "MS-1",
        "source_id": "mesh-M1-user",
